  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Tax 102.20 “Equalized Valuation appeal” means an RSA 71-B:5, II appeal by a municipality of its equalized valuation as determined by the commissioner of revenue administration.\n\nSource. #7152, eff 12-10-99; ss by 8985, eff 9-24-07 (from Tax 102.20); ss by #10623, eff 6-26-14 (from Tax 102.22); ss by 13686, eff 7-19-23",
